cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Soranoha in research, please cite the release you used. A release
  is identified by its head, and each release is archived with its own version
  DOI; see docs/citation.md for the citation forms and worked examples.
title: "Soranoha Aozora Bunko TEI Corpus"
abstract: >-
  Soranoha converts the Japanese texts of Aozora Bunko to TEI P5, with
  plaintext and Markdown projections and a validation report for every work,
  and publishes them as a signed, append-only chain of content-addressed
  releases. Soranoha's encoding is dedicated to the public domain under
  CC0-1.0 and the tooling is licensed Apache-2.0. The underlying works are in
  the public domain, or for a small number under a Creative Commons
  Attribution licence, recorded per work in the release manifest and catalog.
type: dataset
license: CC0-1.0
authors:
  - family-names: "Hodošček"
    given-names: "Bor"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2246-8774"
    affiliation: "Osaka University"
url: "https://soranoha.org"
keywords:
  - Aozora Bunko
  - TEI
  - Japanese literature
  - digital humanities
  - corpus
  - collections as data
